From 9323b5119edefe15393376cc51ec040ae6592bc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 3 ax <3axmail@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:46:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] brand: generate Scoria icons and automate the upstream check

- make_icons.sh renders the new mark into the Windows .ico, macOS .icns
  (Apple 824-tile grid), hicolor PNGs and the game window icon; the macOS app
  now declares the icon and ships it.
- auto_upstream.sh merges upstream in a throwaway worktree, runs the launcher,
  client and UI gates, and pushes sync/upstream-<date> to Entire only when the
  merge is clean. systemd unit and weekly timer are included.
- Drop the stale GPUI launcher description from AGENTS.md.

Co-Authored-By: DeepSeek <noreply@deepseek.com>
---
 crates/horizon-theme/icons/horizon-64.png | Bin 797 -> 4179 bytes
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

